WEBVTT

01:00:29.208 --> 01:00:31.684
they could give people
a ton of autonomy then

01:00:31.708 --> 01:00:36.184
about when to do it, where to do it,
how to do it, with whom to do it.

01:00:36.208 --> 01:00:37.976
And that would work out really well.

01:00:38.000 --> 01:00:41.601
And I think if you take that view,
then giving people that kind of autonomy

01:00:41.625 --> 01:00:43.351
is an expression of loyalty, right?

01:00:43.375 --> 01:00:46.309
You're you're saying,
"I believe in you, I trust you.

01:00:46.333 --> 01:00:48.643
I'm going to let you know
what our objectives are

01:00:48.667 --> 01:00:50.518
and why I think those are worthwhile."

01:00:50.542 --> 01:00:51.875
And then you got this.

01:00:53.000 --> 01:00:54.917
So next question.

01:00:55.833 --> 01:00:58.476
Woman 2: You touched on this
very briefly earlier,

01:00:58.500 --> 01:01:01.518
the difference between
breach and betrayal.